  "description": "AI visibility for Umbraco v13 / .NET 8 — auto-generates per-page Markdown at {url}.md plus /llms.txt and /llms-full.txt manifests, negotiates Accept: text/markdown, advertises the Markdown alternate via Link header and <link rel=\"alternate\">, audits robots.txt against the AI-crawler list (health check), and logs AI traffic. The \"lite\" SKU for the most recent AngularJS-backoffice LTS: configure via appsettings.json and read the request log via SQL — no Settings or AI Traffic dashboards (those ship in the Umbraco v17+ package). Shares the same content-extraction engine as the v17 package.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
